<!--Post: 5594--><!--Time: 1107212159-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5594"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 2:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That is a really good question. Glad you asked...because it provokes me to think. <BR> <BR>Notice that even in the letter &#40;the new complete one on Tom&#39;s page&#41;does not give any hint as to how he tortured his victims.  You get the idea that he used cords or rope to BIND them..or pantyhose, but how do we know HOW he tortured them...and for how long. <BR> <BR>Take a look at the description BTK details for us on how he treated the Oteros... <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/letters.html" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/letters.html</a> <BR>Do you see any indication or mention of HOW he might have TORTURED his victims?  I think that may be in the mention of him getting sexual pleasure from watching his victims die.  Did they have to watch as he...well...you know. <BR> <BR>What you see in his description or break down of what he did to the Oteros are descriptions that are pretty vague..He uses categories to section what he did...but no real true descriptions of TORTURE..you see Bondage, Garrotte, Death, and Clothes...but you don&#39;t see a category called &#34;TORTURE&#34;. <BR> <BR>I wonder if BTK is really living up to his name..BIND, TORTURE, KILL.  I have seen mention of binding, and killing...but where is the torturing?  Is he missing a step?  Why is it that he is keeping the TORTURE segment from us?  Just some wild questions.  Thanks. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5594-->
<!--Post: 5596--><!--Time: 1107212663-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5596"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Clairevoient<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Clairevoient<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 3:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->She was his Mary Kelly.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5596-->
