<!--Post: 5613--><!--Time: 1107218286-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5613"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bojo<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bojo<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 4:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Featherw, <BR>It is my understanding that he strangles them to the point of death, revives them, and then does it again.  That qualifies as torture to me.   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5613-->
<!--Post: 5615--><!--Time: 1107218942-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5615"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 4:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Jack the Ripper Victim <BR> <BR>Mary Jeanette Kelly &#40;25&#41; Died 9th November 1888  <BR>Just as the panic created by the &#39;Ripper&#39; begins to die, the killer performs the most brutal of all his murders, taking several hours to finish the dismemberment. The victim is later discovered to be pregnant. <BR>  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5615-->
<!--Post: 5616--><!--Time: 1107219258-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5616"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 4:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Featherw, Mary Kelly was one of the victims of Jack the Ripper.  <BR> <BR> <BR>Heres an excellent website about the Whitechapel murders. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.casebook.org" target=_top>http://www.casebook.org</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
